Dashboard Design Task

Internship

Elevate Labs – Data Analyst Internship

Objective

To design a dashboard that tracks key business metrics and provides insights into sales performance.

Dataset

The dataset contains:

- Month
- Sales
- Profit
- Category

Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)

- Total Sales: 101000
- Total Profit: 17200
- Total Orders: 6
- Average Profit: 2867

Category-wise Sales Summary

- Electronics: 52000
- Furniture: 35000
- Clothing: 14000

Insights

- Electronics generated the highest sales.
- Furniture was the second-highest performing category.
- Sales showed an increasing trend from January to June.

Tools Used

- Google Sheets
- Microsoft PowerPoint

Conclusion

The dashboard provides a clear overview of sales performance and helps identify business trends using KPI metrics and category-wise analysis.
